gent team templates for OpenClaw that can be installed in minutes. Nine packs are available covering development, content creation, marketing, finance, health, fitness, e-commerce, and solopreneurship use cases. Each pack includes multiple specialized agents with distinct personalities. The solution is self-hosted, works with your own API keys, and allows customization after installation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--6EyypdQW--/f_auto/v1770661011/posts/dk2WOQHNm?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-09T18:16:51.471Z"},{"id":"mYeRLfDJr","title":"The Horde Squad Hits 3,000 Members! \u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udd25","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-horde-squad-hits-3-000-members--myerlfdjr","summary":"The Horde, a developer community squad on Daily Dev, has reached 3,000 members. The announcement celebrates this milestone and invites new developers to join their growing community of developers and tech enthusiasts.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--NKnh9oph--/f_auto/v1755862441/posts/mYeRLfDJr?_a=BAMClqZW0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-22T11:34:00.875Z"},{"id":"qJoKbq8Kt","title":"Moving UP! \u2694\ufe0f 7th spot on the Daily.dev leaderboard with 42K reputation!","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/moving-up-7th-spot-on-the-daily-dev-leaderboard-with-42k-reputation--qjokbq8kt","summary":"A user celebrates reaching 7th place on the daily.dev leaderboard with 42K reputation points, expressing determination to continue climbing the rankings.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--iDqVCOnP--/f_auto/v1755165729/posts/qJoKbq8Kt?_a=BAMClqZW0","num_upvotes":57,"num_comments":40,"created_at":"2025-08-14T10:02:09.637Z"},{"id":"H3OGJybkd","title":"Create Your Retro 8-Bit Profile Card with 8bitcn! \ud83c\udfae","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/create-your-retro-8-bit-profile-card-with-8bitcn--h3ogjybkd","sum